=== list-zip-fatarrow-once-infinity
from: Base58 0.0.5 lib/Base58.rakumod:28
license: MIT
feature: infix Z=>
--- code
my @alphabet = <1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 A B C>;
my $s = '2B';
say $s.comb.map({(once %(@alphabet Z=> ^∞)){$_}});
--- expect
