=== list-zip-fatarrow-angle
from: CSS::Properties 0.10.9 lib/CSS/Properties/Util.rakumod:85
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: infix Z=>
--- code
my @hsl = 120, 50, 25;
my $r = [ <num percent percent> Z=> @hsl ];
say $r.elems;
say $r.map(*.key);
say $r[1].value;
--- expect
3
(num percent percent)
50

=== list-zip-for-destructure
from: DBIish 0.6.9 lib/DBDish/StatementHandle.rakumod:121
license: BSD-2-Clause
feature: infix Z
--- code
my @a = 1, 'Ann';
my @column-name = <id name>;
for @a Z @column-name -> ($v, $n) {
    say "$n: $v";
}
--- expect
id: 1
name: Ann

=== list-zip-flat-pairs-ahead
from: Cro::Core 0.8.10 lib/Cro.rakumod:502
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: infix Z
--- code
my @components-in = <source parse route>;
for flat @components-in Z @components-in[1..*] -> $comp, $next {
