=== list-zip-bracketed-ne
from: Graph 0.1.3 lib/Graph/Hypercube.rakumod:29
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: infix Z[ne]
--- code
for <0110 0111 1001> -> $t {
    my $f = '0110';
    say "$t: ", ($f.comb Z[ne] $t.comb).sum == 1;
}
--- expect
0110: False
0111: True
1001: False

