=== list-zip-bracketed-sub
from: Getopt::Long 0.4.2 lib/Getopt/Long.rakumod:371
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: infix Z[&sub]
--- code
sub make-positional($type, $ordinal) { "$ordinal:$type" }
my @positional-types = Int, Str;
my @ordinals = <first second third>;
my @positionals = @positional-types.map(*.^name) Z[&make-positional] @ordinals;
say @positionals;
--- expect
[first:Int second:Str]

