=== list-cross-fatarrow-all-pairs
from: Graph 0.1.3 lib/Graph.rakumod:326
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: infix X=>
--- code
my @vs = 1, 2;
my @edges = (@vs X=> @vs);
say @edges.elems;
